{"unit_id":"awnlight__talon-ui#card-zh","repo":"awnlight/talon-ui","commit":"c8904793a069901ed3516deb1a4efe0475317ca9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Talon UI 是面向 DeepSeek Harness agent 的交互式终端界面插件。它通过 Cordis 插件和 bundle 接入 DSH，在真实 TTY 中呈现流式对话、工具审批与用户提问面板，并提供斜杠命令、模型选择和会话恢复。用户可以在终端继续历史会话、切换工作区会话或创建新会话，也可查看状态并正常退出。适合希望在命令行中完整交互操作 DSH agent 的用户；需要可用的 DSH 主机、终端和宿主配置的模型服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:82","src/app/controller.ts:439","src/backend/commands.ts:15"]}
{"unit_id":"awnlight__talon-ui#card-en","repo":"awnlight/talon-ui","commit":"c8904793a069901ed3516deb1a4efe0475317ca9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Talon UI is a terminal interface plugin for DeepSeek Harness agents. It presents streaming conversations, approval prompts, and user questions in an interactive TTY. Commands show status, select models, resume, or start fresh. Requires a DSH host, terminal, and configured model service.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:82","src/app/controller.ts:439","src/backend/commands.ts:15"]}
